        strategy: {
          basic: 'Build points with high-rank cards (Kings, Queens, Jacks as points). Use scuttles to destroy threats.',
          intermediate: 'Queen protection is crucial â€” a Queen in your tableau prevents Jacks and most scuttles from targeting your cards. Play Queens early.',
          advanced: 'King lowering strategy: with 3 Kings lowering the target to 7, the game ends very quickly. Pressure opponents who are building Queens with Jacks (steal) and Tens (clear effects). Eight (glasses) while opponent has a weak hand forces them to play suboptimally.',
